==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==

* This stage is no joke, a lot of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] such as [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] would work well.
* If you have anti-Red Super Rares and Ubers, they are surely welcomed. [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] work really well for damage, and if you have trouble with the Shy Boy, bring a good [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] or anti-Red [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd controller]] such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]].

